<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>救生艇新闻：博客——保护人类</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/</link><description></description><lastBuildDate>Fri, 21 Aug 2026 12:21:59 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>中国的 RAM 达到 9000 MT/s，甚至可以与西方游戏 PC 的内存速度和延迟相匹配</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/chinese-ram-hits-9000-mt-s-and-even-matches-the-speed-and-latency-of-the-memory-in-our-western-gaming-pcs</link><description>所以，这就是 48 GB 的“国产”，即中国的 DDR5 RAM，达到 9,000 MT/s。诚然，我们的记忆力远远超出了西方人的记忆力， &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/chinese-ram-hits-9000-mt-s-and-even-matches-the-speed-and-latency-of-the-memory-in-our-western-gaming-pcs.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Fri, 21 Aug 2026 12:21:57 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/chinese-ram-hits-9000-mt-s-and-even-matches-the-speed-and-latency-of-the-memory-in-our-western-gaming-pcs</guid></item><item><title>研究表明，每日服用药物可使转移性胰腺癌的生存率提高一倍</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/investigational-daily-pill-doubles-survival-in-metastatic-pancreatic-cancer-study-shows</link><description>在加州大学洛杉矶分校共同领导的一项国际研究中，研究人员发现，在 RAS G12 和总体或意向治疗 (ITT) 人群（包括有或没有已确定的肿瘤 RAS 突变的患者）中，研究性靶向治疗与标准化疗相比，显着延长了既往治疗过的转移性胰腺癌患者的总生存期，并将死亡风险降低了 60%。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/investigational-daily-pill-doubles-survival-in-metastatic-pancreatic-cancer-study-shows.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Fri, 21 Aug 2026 12:06:57 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/investigational-daily-pill-doubles-survival-in-metastatic-pancreatic-cancer-study-shows</guid></item><item><title>设计跨越血脑屏障的超分子疗法</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/designing-supramolecular-therapies-to-cross-the-blood-brain-barrier</link><description>西北医学的一项新研究发现了关键的分子设计原理，可以帮助超分子疗法跨越血脑屏障，这是这种治疗神经系统疾病的新方法的主要挑战。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/designing-supramolecular-therapies-to-cross-the-blood-brain-barrier2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Fri, 21 Aug 2026 11:51:57 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/designing-supramolecular-therapies-to-cross-the-blood-brain-barrier</guid></item><item><title>AI MetaHacking：Microsoft Copilot 的 3 个缺陷如何暴露新的攻击方法</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/ai-metahacking-how-3-microsoft-copilot-flaws-exposed-a-new-attack-method</link><description>Varonis 威胁实验室在未对任何代码进行逆向工程的情况下发现了一个严重的 Microsoft Copilot 漏洞 CVE-2026-24301。研究人员只是要求 Copilot 解释其自身的安全限制，Copilot 确实这么做了。微软于 8 月 18 日修补了这个绰号为 CoSnitch 的漏洞。这是 Varonis 今年披露的第三个 Copilot 漏洞，人工智能元黑客发现方法可能比漏洞本身更重要。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/ai-metahacking-how-3-microsoft-copilot-flaws-exposed-a-new-attack-method.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Fri, 21 Aug 2026 11:36:57 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/ai-metahacking-how-3-microsoft-copilot-flaws-exposed-a-new-attack-method</guid></item><item><title>罕见的超磁星可能是解决90年前量子悬案的关键</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/rare-ultra-magnetic-star-may-be-key-to-solving-90-year-old-quantum-cold-case</link><description>天文学家可能刚刚证实了量子力学最奇怪的方面之一：看似真空的空间可以改变光的行为。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/rare-ultra-magnetic-star-may-be-key-to-solving-90-year-old-quantum-cold-case.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Fri, 21 Aug 2026 11:21:57 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/rare-ultra-magnetic-star-may-be-key-to-solving-90-year-old-quantum-cold-case</guid></item><item><title>“Chameleon”芯片可适应不断变化的数据速度，将预测误差减少多达 40 倍</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/chameleon-chip-adapts-to-changing-data-speeds-cutting-prediction-errors-by-up-to-40-fold</link><description>由电气工程学院和半导体技术研究生院的 Shinhyun Choi 讲座教授领导的研究小组开发了一种可编程动态忆阻器（PDM），这是一种时间响应特性可以设置并保持多种状态的半导体器件，以及基于该器件的集成阵列。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/chameleon-chip-adapts-to-changing-data-speeds-cutting-prediction-errors-by-up-to-40-fold2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Fri, 21 Aug 2026 11:06:57 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/chameleon-chip-adapts-to-changing-data-speeds-cutting-prediction-errors-by-up-to-40-fold</guid></item><item><title>大脑植入物使用红外光发送神经信号</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/brain-implant-uses-infrared-light-to-send-neural-signals</link><description>Ability Neurotech 的 BCI 植入物记录来自大脑表面的神经信号，并将数据发送到体外进行处理。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/brain-implant-uses-infrared-light-to-send-neural-signals.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Fri, 21 Aug 2026 10:51:57 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/brain-implant-uses-infrared-light-to-send-neural-signals</guid></item><item><title>研究表明，大脑测试可以在医生发现痴呆症之前预测痴呆症</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/brain-test-could-predict-dementia-before-doctors-can-see-it-study-suggests</link><description>早期症状包括忘记事情或最近发生的事情、即使在熟悉的地方也会迷路或困惑、在交谈或交谈时出现问题、感到焦虑或愤怒以及表现出不当行为。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/brain-test-could-predict-dementia-before-doctors-can-see-it-study-suggests.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Fri, 21 Aug 2026 10:36:57 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/brain-test-could-predict-dementia-before-doctors-can-see-it-study-suggests</guid></item><item><title>JCI：肺科、重症监护和睡眠医学科，以及</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/jci-division-of-pulmonary-critical-care-and-sleep-medicine-and</link><description>7&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/jci8.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Fri, 21 Aug 2026 10:21:57 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/jci-division-of-pulmonary-critical-care-and-sleep-medicine-and</guid></item><item><title>微生物组揭示了癌症研究的未来</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/what-the-microbiome-reveals-about-the-future-of-cancer-research</link><description>然而资金只是等式的一部分。微生物组科学并不完全适合单一学科或机构，没有任何一个实验室或癌症中心可以单独回答这些问题。将发现推进临床试验并最终推进标准护理需要研究机构、医疗保健系统、政府和慈善机构之间的协调。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/what-the-microbiome-reveals-about-the-future-of-cancer-research.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Fri, 21 Aug 2026 10:06:57 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/what-the-microbiome-reveals-about-the-future-of-cancer-research</guid></item></channel></rss>